"[\n  {\n    \"i\": 0,\n    \"cls\": \"relative min-h-screen bg-white text-black pt-24 lg:pt-32 pb-12 lg:pb-20 flex fle\",\n    \"text\": \"YOUR AI MARKETING AGENT\\nYOUR AI\\nMARKETING\\nAGENT\\n\\nOther tools give you dashboards.\\nWe post, write, audit, and publish for you — while learning your brand.\\n\\nTHE MANIFESTO\\n\\n/ROOT/MANIFESTO.MD\\n\\n01We believe marketing shouldn't eat your entire week.\\n02It should run itself — posting to your socials, writing in your voice, growing your rankings.\\n03That's what we built.\\n01\\n\\nNo Agencies\\n\\n02\\n\\nNo Content Calendar Panic\\n\\n03\\n\\nJust Growth\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"i\": 1,\n    \"cls\": \"bg-[#050505] text-white relative overflow-hidden py-24 lg:py-32\",\n    \"text\": \"YOUR AGENT AT WORK\\nONE AGENT.\\nEVERYTHING HANDLED.\\n\\nSocial posts, blog articles, site audits, keyword tracking, backlink monitoring. You used to do all of this by hand. Your agent does it before breakfast.\\n\\n/01\\nRUNS YOUR SOCIAL MEDIA\\nPOST\\n\\nCreates posts in your voice, schedules them at the best time, and publishes to LinkedIn, Instagram, Facebook, X, and TikTok. You just approve — or let it run.\\n\\nLinkedIn\\n5 lessons from scaling...\\nPOSTED\\nInstagram\\nBehind the scenes at...\\nSCHEDULED\\nX\\nThread: Why most SaaS...\\nDRAFTING\\n5 PLATFORMS CONNECTED\\nBEST TIME: 9:15 AM\\n/02\\nFILLS YOUR BLOG\\nWRITE\\n\\nResearches topics, outlines, writes, reviews, polishes, generates images, and publishes to your CMS. A full content pipeline that sounds like you, not a robot.\\n\\nMon\\n10 Tips for Better...\\nPUBLISHED\\nWed\\nHow to Choose a...\\nREVIEWING\\nFri\\nWhy Your Business...\\nWRITING\\n→ 13+ CMS PLATFORMS\\n/03\\nFINDS HIDDEN PROBLEMS\\nAUDIT\\n\\n40+ checks per page — broken links, speed issues, missing tags, security gaps, structured data. Your agent finds every problem hiding in your site before Google does.\\n\\nCRITICAL: 12\\n×\\n/blog/canonical-error\\n×\\n/pricing/missing-h1\\n✓\\n/about/performance\\n/04\\nWATCHES EVERYTHING\\nTRACK\\n\\nKeywords, backlinks, competitors, social engagement, follower growth — all monitored daily. When something changes, your agent tells you what happened and what to do.\\n\\nKEYWORDS\\n+12 positions\\nFOLLOWERS\\n+89 this week\\nBACKLINKS\\n3 broken\\nAGENT ALERT SENT\\n/05\\nREMEMBERS YOUR BRAND\\nLEARN\\n\\nYour voice. Your audience. Your competitors. Your goals. It remembers everything and gets sharper with every conversation — so every post and article fits your business.\\n\\n/06\\nYOUR MARKETING DIRECTOR\\nCHAT\\n\\nLike texting a marketing director who knows your brand inside out. Ask for advice. Run an analysis. Get a strategy. Any time, any question — your agent is always ready.\\n\\nWhy did engagement drop this week?\\n\\nLinkedIn reach dropped 40% — you posted at 8pm instead of 9am. I've rescheduled this week's posts to optimal times.\\n\\nAI\\n\\nAlso write a blog post about it.\\n\\n24/7 ONLINE\\nALWAYS ON\\nIt runs while you sleep.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"i\": 2,\n    \"cls\": \"bg-white text-black relative z-30 -mt-20 rounded-t-[60px] lg:rounded-t-[80px] sh\",\n    \"text\": \"WHY US\\nNOT A TOOL.\\nA TEAMMATE.\\n\\nTools give you dashboards. Your agent gives you results. It thinks, monitors, creates, and acts — so you can focus on running your business.\\n\\nSYSTEM_STATUS\\nONLINE\\nCHATGPT\\nOnline\\nCLAUDE\\nOnline\\nPERPLEXITY\\nOnline\\nGEMINI\\nOnline\\n(01)\\nStop Juggling 7 Tools\\n\\nBuffer for social. Semrush for audits. Ahrefs for backlinks. Jasper for writing. You spend more time switching tabs than growing your business. Your agent replaces the entire stack — it posts, scans, writes, tracks, and publishes. One conversation. Full cycle.\\n\\nONE AGENT. FULL CYCLE.\\n(02)\\nIt Remembers Everything\\n\\nYour agent learns your brand, your voice, your audience, and your goals. It remembers what worked and what didn't. Every recommendation gets sharper over time. Every post and article sounds like your best marketing team wrote it — because your agent knows you better than any agency could.\\n\\nGETS SMARTER EVERY WEEK.\\n(03)\\nIt Works While You Sleep\\n\\nEngagement dropped overnight? Your agent already rescheduled posts to better times. A competitor went viral on LinkedIn? It flagged it. Your best blog post started losing traffic? It drafted a refresh. You wake up to a briefing, not a fire drill.\\n\\n24/7 MONITORING. ZERO PANIC.\\n(04)\\nEvery Channel. Covered.\\n\\nYour audience is on LinkedIn, Instagram, Google, ChatGPT, and Perplexity — all at once. Your agent posts to every social platform, optimizes for every search engine, and structures your content so AI recommends you. Show up everywhere your customers are looking.\\n\\nSOCIAL + SEARCH + AI. ONE AGENT.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"i\": 3,\n    \"cls\": \"bg-[#0A0A0A] text-white relative overflow-hidden py-32 lg:py-40\",\n    \"text\": \"WHO BUILT THIS\\nWe Build AI\\nFor A Living.\\n\\nMygom.tech is a software company. We build AI-powered products for companies across Europe - from computer vision systems to agentic platforms that make decisions autonomously.\\n\\nMygomSEO started as an internal tool. We were running marketing for our own sites and clients — scheduling social posts, writing blog articles, auditing pages, tracking keywords — juggling seven different tools, copy-pasting between dashboards. We already knew how to build agentic systems. So we built one agent to replace them all.\\n\\nWe use it every day. If it breaks, we feel it first.\\n\\nSEE WHAT WE BUILD\\nTHE TEAM BEHIND MYGOMSEO\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"i\": 4,\n    \"cls\": \"relative bg-white border-b border-black/10 overflow-hidden\",\n    \"text\": \"LIVE FROM THE SCANNER\\nTHE PRODUCT IS THE PROOF.\\n\\nEvery number below is a real count from our database, updated every five minutes. No testimonials. No case studies. Just what the free scanner has done.\\n\\n1,755\\nSCANS RUN\\nReal audits completed\\n217,321\\nURLS ANALYZED\\nPages checked end-t